==Trivia==
*The Seal of Recorded Sound likely includes the Sigil of Calling given the similarities in names and effect. The Seal of Pursuit is likely to allow the pouches to pursue a specific location, serving a similar function to the Guidance seal in Chapter 81.
**It is reasonable to assume that the seal variants in Chapter 81 are missing certain aspects of the variant in Chapter 34 due to the lack of need for a Seal of Pursuit. In other words, the symbols that are unique to the version of Chapter 34 are part of the Seal of Pursuit.
*The layered spell for the Pouch of Calling is Agott’s invention.{{Ref|m|35|7}}{{Ref|m|34|23}}

